  "label": "Islamophobia Stereotype: Muslims hate pigs because pigs mate with donkeys",
  "description": "This is a false and derogatory stereotype used to mock Muslims by falsely attributing a baseless biological claim (pigs mating with donkeys) to them. It exploits a sensitive religious taboo (the prohibition of pork in Islam) and distorts it with an absurd and offensive biological claim, thereby reinforcing prejudice and hostility toward Muslims.",
